        <h1>Publications</h1>
        <p class="sub">209 works spanning Active Inference, computational entomology, cognitive security, art &amp; synergetics, genetics, and open science — as of August 2026</p>
        <div class="meta-pills">
            <span class="pill gold">Scholar metrics are dated in the verification layer</span>
            <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DXjPFtYAAAAJ&hl=en" class="pill">Google Scholar</a>
