        <section class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="pub-routes-heading">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 id="pub-routes-heading">Research Routes and Topic Clusters</h2>
                <p>Start with a domain page when you want context, or use the searchable table for exact works, DOIs, and paper folders.</p>
                <div class="section-divider"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="cards cards-3">
                <a class="card" href="domain-active-inference.html"><div class="icon">FEP</div><h3>Active Inference &amp; Free Energy Principle</h3><p>Generative models, belief sharing, GNN, CEREBRUM, FEP formalization, and learning infrastructure.</p><span class="tag">Domain page</span></a>
                <a class="card" href="domain-entomology.html"><div class="icon">ENT</div><h3>Entomology &amp; Social Insects</h3><p>Ant colony cognition, foraging, physiology, transcriptomics, and computational collective behavior.</p><span class="tag">Domain page</span></a>
                <a class="card" href="domain-cognitive-security.html"><div class="icon">SEC</div><h3>Cognitive Security</h3><p>Narrative ecosystems, P3IF, information commons, ATLAS, cognitive integrity, and digital rhetoric.</p><span class="tag">Domain page</span></a>
                <a class="card" href="domain-computational.html"><div class="icon">COM</div><h3>Computational Methods</h3><p>Reproducible research templates, MDKV, discovery engines, software catalogs, and agent-ready documents.</p><span class="tag">Domain page</span></a>
                <a class="card" href="domain-biomedicine.html"><div class="icon">BIO</div><h3>Genetics &amp; Biomedicine</h3><p>Gene expression, honey bee evolution, nuclear structure, population genetics, and biology education.</p><span class="tag">Domain page</span></a>
                <a class="card" href="works/"><div class="icon">DOI</div><h3>Canonical Work Pages</h3><p>Per-work landing pages with citations, abstracts, source links, related works, and verification context.</p><span class="tag">Works index</span></a>
            </div>
            <p class="text-center mt-2"><a href="cite-verify.html" class="btn btn-outline">Citation and verification guide</a> <a href="search.html?q=active%20inference" class="btn btn-outline">Search Active Inference</a></p>
        </section>
